  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "I've never used Framer. Will I actually be able to setup template by myself?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Yes. If you can edit a Google Slide, you can edit this. Framer is drag-and-drop, no code — you'll spend more time picking your own images than fighting the editor.",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "What happens right after I purchase?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "You'll get a Remix link in your invoice and email — click it, and the template gets added straight to your Framer account. From there you can customize and preview everything before you touch a domain or publish anything.",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Do I need a paid Framer plan?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "You can build and customize for free. You'll only need a paid Framer plan when you're ready to publish on your own domain — the CMS features in this template work best on the Pro plan.",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "How fast can I realistically get this live?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Most people are live within a few days of focused work. If your content is ready to drop in, same-day is realistic.",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "What if I get stuck?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Start with the docs — most setup questions are answered there. If you're still hitting an error, email me and I'll help you sort it out. And if you'd rather not touch the setup at all, I offer a Done-For-You package for $1,500 — I set everything up for you, end to end.",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Do you offer refunds?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Since it's a digital product, no refunds once it's delivered. But if something's not working as expected, tell me — I'll help you sort it out before you write it off.",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Can I use this template for a client project?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "The license covers one live site. If you're building it for a client or a separate project, you'll need a separate license per site — happy to help you figure out what fits if you're doing multiple.",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Will I get future updates for free?",
    "href": null
  },
  {
    "tag": "P",
    "text": "Free, for life. When the template gets updated, you get the new version at no extra cost.\n\nVài chỗ mình để nguyên theo giả định chuẩn ngành template (refund policy, 1 license = 1 site) — nếu chính sách thực tế của bạn khác (ví dụ multi-site license, hay có refund trong X ngày), báo mình chỉnh lại câu 6 và 7 cho khớp.",
    "href": null
  },
